From: TreeOS
Subject: [PATCH] mfd: rk8xx: give rk817-codec an of_compatible

Without this, the rk817-codec platform device has no device tree node,
so ASoC cannot match the simple-audio-card's sound-dai phandle and the
card fails with "asoc-simple-card: parse error".

--- a/drivers/mfd/rk8xx-core.c
+++ b/drivers/mfd/rk8xx-core.c
@@ -120,7 +120,7 @@ static const struct mfd_cell rk817s[] = {
 		.name = "rk808-rtc",
 		.num_resources = ARRAY_SIZE(rk817_rtc_resources),
 		.resources = &rk817_rtc_resources[0],
 	},
-	{ .name = "rk817-codec", },
+	{ .name = "rk817-codec", .of_compatible = "rockchip,rk817-codec" },
 	{
 		.name = "rk817-charger",
 		.num_resources = ARRAY_SIZE(rk817_charger_resources),
